  ],
  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Combine the above ingredients and bring to a boil in a round-bottom flask while flushing with O2-free gas (10% H2, 10% CO2, 80% N2)."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "comment": "Stopper anaerobically with butyl rubber, wire or seal closed, and autoclave at 121ºC."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "After autoclaving, allow to cool, open without admitting oxygen and while flushing with gas, add the following filter-sterilized ingredients:"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "comment": "Mix together and filter-sterilize. Store at -20C."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "comment": "Add volatile fatty acids to about 70-80 ml of NaOH and mix. Add NaOH to bring final volume to 100 ml. If not used the same day, filter-sterilize and store at 4C."
    }
  ]
}